    "question": "An electric water pump raises $500\\text{ litres}$ of water through a vertical height of $25\\text{ m}$ in $1\\text{ minute}$ ($g = 10\\text{ m/s}^2$, density of water $= 1000\\text{ kg/m}^3$). The output power of the pump is:",
